{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:30:14.731Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"80425827ec0c311337905fb1ad0f6f1dbfaff0f7b6feb9dfeac40adfc0ed5981","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon Sato: you first reported the kiosks offline at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug (company time zone, UTC-5). Your message said both inbound lanes at Vantorre's Hartford plant showed a white screen after badge scan.\n\nThe guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard from your 10:42 report until the kiosks came back. Mateo said kiosk 1 was back at 11:03, and the guard checked in trailer 8836 then, and dispatch could see it. You posted at 11:08 that both lanes had been working since 11:07. So the clipboard fallback ran for about 25 minutes. The channel doesn't say exactly when the guard stopped using it, so I can't give you a precise end time.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":9,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:30:18.282Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ddc681d72d77eed10aef2acd543b3b6d423668647ca1fe36d4c16a926c5db5df","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon, I replied in the #inc-vtg-hartford thread. You first reported the kiosks offline at **10:42 AM on 3 Aug**. Your message said both inbound lanes at Vantorre's Hartford plant showed a white screen after badge scan.\n\nThe guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard from then until the kiosks recovered:\n- **11:03 AM:** Mateo posted that kiosk 1 was back and the guard had checked in trailer 8836, which dispatch could see.\n- **11:07 AM:** You posted at 11:08 that both lanes had been working as of 11:07.\n\nThat makes the clipboard fallback about 25 minutes. The channel doesn't say exactly when the guard stopped using it, so I couldn't give an exact end time.\n\nI took the times as the channel's local time, UTC-5. That matches the timestamps on the messages."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
